        <definition>ClkDivConfig tle92466ed::DITHER_CLK_DIV::CalculateFromTrefClkUs</definition>
        <argsstring>(float t_ref_clk_us) noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>CalculateFromTrefClkUs</name>
        <qualifiedname>tle92466ed::DITHER_CLK_DIV::CalculateFromTrefClkUs</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>float</type>
          <declname>t_ref_clk_us</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Pick MANT/EXP that approximate a desired tref_clk in microseconds. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Tries every exponent 0..15 and rounds MANT to the nearest valid value (1..1023). Returns the closest representable tref_clk.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>MANT is forced ≥ 1 (MANT=0 disables the chip&apos;s averager).</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>t_ref_clk_us</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Desired reference clock period in microseconds. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structtle92466ed_1_1DITHER__CLK__DIV_1_1ClkDivConfig" kindref="compound">ClkDivConfig</ref> with the dither-sync flags zeroed; the caller can OR them on as needed. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
